# Ajani Resolute: "-10: You get an emblem with 'Creatures you control get +2/+2.'" Loyalty 10 takes four turns of his own 0
# (gain 1 life) and a Lightning Helix each turn: every life gain is one loyalty counter (2 + 4 x 2 = 10 on turn 7), and on turn 9
# the -10 is paid, which sends Ajani to the graveyard (CR 704.5i) but not the emblem, which lasts (CR 114.4, 114.5). It pumps Mother
# of Runes that Bot1 controls, 1/1 to 3/3, from the command zone (CR 613.4c), and not the one Bot2 controls.
